ogress":0}],"id":0,"title":"Comments","section_type":"comments"}],"post_info":{"genres":["Action","Drama","Sport"],"id":12308,"type":"MOVIE","title":"Versus","logo":"","image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk43/shows/1cccfe3b-b0f0-4b91-a67c-f9621c8621b8.jpg","background_image":"https://cdn6.albox.co/storage/disk45/shows/a3d61dc5-b538-44b6-8b3c-a7aa34f246b4.jpg","likes":11,"dislikes":3,"views":3826,"release_date":"1478131200000","length":6627,"description":"Victor Stroev aka Russian Hammer is a youth Mix Fight champion willing to win the main fight of his career - the World Champion title. Hammer is right up there as a chance encounter turning into a fight with a sports mobster Shark ends up to be a tragedy for Victor. Victor gets into a terrible car crash that makes it doubtful that he will ever be able to go on with his career in sports, any blow can kill him. Vera whom Shark is trying to get, chooses Victor which makes Shark even more furious. Now Shark will do anything to make Russian Hammer get on the ring and make this fight the last one for him. Victor is not used to give up and ready to risk - he has to defend the honor of his country and the woman he loves. Vera realizes she has to betray Victor in order to save him.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":4.8}],"value":4.8,"age":"R"},"episode_id":12308,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}